  "protocol": "unseen-topology holdout v1 (pre-registered)",
  "selection": {
    "representative": "uniform draw (seed 20260801) over ELIGIBLE topologies, i.e. those whose training-clip count is at most max(2x source median, 40). Estimates average unseen-topology performance over the ELIGIBLE frame, which the size cap restricts \u2014 not over the corpus. Fixed per-source quotas restrict it further.",
    "stress": "descriptor-diverse remainder panel: farthest-point sampling over the eligible topologies REMAINING after the representative draw. It over-samples descriptor extremes by construction, so it probes descriptor-stress, NOT a worst case \u2014 farthest-point sampling does not establish one. Report separately, never pooled with the representative bucket.",
    "shared_budget_frac": 0.08,
    "reporting": "topology-macro averages within each bucket, not clip-weighted aggregates, so a few clip-rich topologies cannot dominate."
  },
